    "plot": "The Adventures of Ozzie and Harriet is an American sitcom, airing on ABC from October 3, 1952 through March 26, 1966, starring the real life Nelson family. After a long run on radio, the show was brought to television where it continued its success, running on both radio and television for a few years. The series stars Ozzie Nelson and his wife, singer Harriet Nelson, and their young sons, David and Eric \"Ricky\" Nelson. Don DeFore had a recurring role as the Nelsons' friendly neighbor \"Thorny\".",
